{"version":1,"content":"<p>金秋10月，候鳥在黑龍江多地休憩聚集，野趣盎然。</p><p>黑龍江省地處「東亞──澳大利西亞候鳥遷徙路線」中段，濕地成為候鳥南遷的「補給站」。</p><p>（新華社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T06:18:43.162226+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":72,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T05:35:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T16:37:49.729804+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"1a529612f103f82d48b5208acf6feb824792569acd990ee92e0dba44560d5a6d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}